\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/f7b89eaf-6f62-4e8a-94bf-f3edbc6d95a1/couleuvre_helvetique/public\"><img alt=\"Couleuvre helvétique (août)\" class=\"notion-collection-card__cover medium\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/f7b89eaf-6f62-4e8a-94bf-f3edbc6d95a1/couleuvre_helvetique/public\"></span><div class=\"notion-collection-card__content notion-collection-card__property-list\"><div class=\"notion-property notion-property__title notion-collection-card__property title notion-semantic-string\"><div class=\"notion-property__title__icon-wrapper\"></div>Couleuvre helvétique (août)</div></div></div><div id=\"block-sejours-hebergements-yvoir-photos-des-hbergements-salamandre-tachete-novembre\" class=\"notion-collection-card gallery\"><a id=\"block-sejours-hebergements-yvoir-photos-des-hbergements-salamandre-tachete-novembre\" href=\"/sejours/hebergements-yvoir/photos-des-hbergements/salamandre-tachete-novembre\" class=\"notion-link notion-collection-card__anchor\" data-link-uri=\"/sejours/hebergements-yvoir/photos-des-hbergements/salamandre-tachete-novembre\">Salamandre tachetée (novembre)</a><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/5465059a-407b-4e0b-9ff9-c11916b851ff/20221116_135325_10B47022/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/5465059a-407b-4e0b-9ff9-c11916b851ff/20221116_135325_10B47022/public\"><img alt=\"Salamandre tachetée (novembre)\" class=\"notion-collection-card__cover medium\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/5465059a-407b-4e0b-9ff9-c11916b851ff/20221116_135325_10B47022/public\"></span><div class=\"notion-collection-card__content notion-collection-card__property-list\"><div class=\"notion-property notion-property__title notion-collection-card__property title notion-semantic-string\"><div class=\"notion-property__title__icon-wrapper\"></div>Salamandre tachetée (novembre)</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><h1 id=\"block-fb51ed0e35b14eb1bfde7d87bd97c402\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Espèces observées</h1><p id=\"block-6afd76aa81814a74becb684589562e86\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\"><strong>Les espèces végétales et animales observées par les naturalistes sont régulièrement enregistrées sur Observations.be.</strong> Tu en trouveras la liste complète en suivant le lien ci-dessous.</p><div id=\"block-14d5aa4b960d4d17966bfcb64ffb2dcf\" class=\"notion-bookmark\"><a href=\"https://observations.be/locations/241623/species/\" class=\"notion-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"notion-bookmark__content\"><h5 class=\"notion-bookmark__title\">Fonds d'Ahinvaux (NA)</h5><div class=\"notion-bookmark__link\"><div><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/c7b0aad2-34d6-410a-b0c1-d1d76dd5dbaf/apple-touch-icon/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/c7b0aad2-34d6-410a-b0c1-d1d76dd5dbaf/apple-touch-icon/public\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"notion-icon\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/c7b0aad2-34d6-410a-b0c1-d1d76dd5dbaf/apple-touch-icon/public\"></span></div><p>observations.be</p></div></div><div class=\"notion-bookmark__cover\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/ebfb860d-1e73-45d8-b38c-77cca84f931d/logo-obs-white-192x192/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/ebfb860d-1e73-45d8-b38c-77cca84f931d/logo-obs-white-192x192/public\"><img alt=\"Fonds d'Ahinvaux (NA)\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/ebfb860d-1e73-45d8-b38c-77cca84f931d/logo-obs-white-192x192/public\"></span></div></a></div><h2 id=\"block-cef265585f024edfa32864ff16e3bf57\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Enregistrer tes observations</h2><p id=\"block-c399c544fc7f4be3becf8158983d7df8\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Enregistre toutes tes observations sur <a href=\"https://observations.be/locations/241623/\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"https://observations.be/locations/241623/\">Observations.be</a> ou <a href=\"https://www.inaturalist.org/projects/les-4-sources-yvoir-belgique?tab=observations\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"https://www.inaturalist.org/projects/les-4-sources-yvoir-belgique?tab=observations\">iNaturalist</a>. Le plus simple, c’est d’installer l’app sur ton téléphone.</p>",
